  "description": "Comfort and practicality are two defining characteristics for any bike. The Electrolite offers both- plus the added benefit of electric bike technology. Powered by a 250 watt silent motor and removable rechargeable battery, you can expand your range and increase the enjoyment on your bike rides. Two separate settings allow the bike to operate in variable speed pedal assist mode for maximum range or full power throttle control for minimal effort.\nLightweight custom 6061 aluminum frame w/ Suntour suspension fork\nShimano Acera 8-speed drivetrain with alloy linear-pull front and rear brakes\nAlloy crankset with sealed cartridge bottom bracket\nAlloy rims with 12/13g stainless steel spokes\n26\" x 2.125\" semi-slick tires with reflective side wall\nLow-rise steel handlebar and adjustable angle alloy stem\nSun comfort cruiser saddle and ergo grips\nSteel chain guard\nDual leg alloy kickstand and rear rack\n250 watt / 36 volt rear hub motor\n36 volt /10 amp lithium polymer battery\n17.4 mph top speed\nUp to 28 miles on a single charge\nDual mode pedal assist or throttle control operation\nAvailable in 17.5\" and 20\" frame sizes",
